{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robert the Red Panda must save his home from the clutches of the worst evil imaginable,  capitalism.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D platformer, explore a vast landscape, helping out those in need as you go.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find lots of secret areas and levels, fighting both easy and difficult bosses. Allowing both casual and more difficult game play making it fun for all ages and play styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to checkout the post story game. There may be more secrets and changes than you might expect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demo will be a fully playable experience, removing a paywall to play and complete the main story of the game.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971900?t=1758243497","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971900?t=1758243497","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971900/1836b09ca616eae2754babf393f7d279cf6efb65/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758243497","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971900/1836b09ca616eae2754babf393f7d279cf6efb65/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758243497","categories":[{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robert the Red Panda must save his home from the clutches of the worst evil imaginable,  capitalism.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this 2D platformer, explore a vast landscape, helping out those in need as you go.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find lots of secret areas an